inding Blues\" - 4:05  (<a href=\"/wiki/Ted_Dunbar\" title=\"Ted Dunbar\">Ted Dunbar</a>)</li>\n<li>\"Total Conversion\" - 6:05  (Dunbar)</li>\n<li>\"Trees and Grass and Things\" - 4:07  (<a href=\"/wiki/Don_Pullen\" title=\"Don Pullen\">Don Pullen</a>)</li>\n<li>\"<a href=\"/wiki/Nica%27s_Dream\" title=\"Nica&#39;s Dream\">Nica's Dream</a>\" - 06:25  (<a href=\"/wiki/Horace_Silver\" title=\"Horace Silver\">Horace Silver</a>)</li>\n<li>\"<a href=\"/wiki/Hi-Fly_(Randy_Weston_song)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hi-Fly (Randy Weston song)\">Hi-Fly</a>\" - 5:50  (<a href=\"/wiki/Randy_Weston\" title=\"Randy Weston\">Randy Weston</a>)</li>\n<li>\"Bougie\" - 7:55  (Dunbar)</li>\n<li>\"Epistrophy\" - 6:45  (<a href=\"/wiki/Thelonious_Monk\" title=\"Thelonious Monk\">Thelonious Monk</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Kenny_Clarke\" title=\"Kenny Clarke\">Kenny Clarke</a>)</li></ol>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Personnel\">Personnel</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Jazz_Guitarist_(album)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Personnel\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ted_Dunbar\" title=\"Ted Dunbar\">Ted Dunbar</a> – guitar</li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"References\">References</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Jazz_Guitarist_(album)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: References\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r1327269900\">.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns-2{column-width:30em}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns-3{column-width:25em}body.skin-vector-2022 .mw-parser-output .reflist-columns-2{column-width:27em}body.skin-vector-2022 .mw-parser-output .reflist-columns-3{column-width:22.5em}